    {
      "id": "claim_298c73fdc44d47819f4c2bbc72e6c866",
      "statement": "The hypermnesic CLI is the engine-host-local surface that skips the network entirely and drives the index, retrieval, write, and serve paths directly, in contrast to the MCP lanes used by remote clients.",
