    {
      "id": "claim_96f732fd3f414a8cb3edfb5510797096",
      "statement": "Read subcommands converge the index to HEAD before answering and several accept --now to force a non-debounced pass, which is what makes a note committed inside the debounce window immediately recall-able.",
