    {
      "id": "claim_46c3d879c22049efad81ee180d7fdd38",
      "statement": "The serve command requires an explicit interface host and refuses to bind 0.0.0.0, exposes read tools always, adds the gated write tool only with --enable-write, accepts tailnet membership as the write boundary only through the bounded --allow-tailnet-write opt-in on a CGNAT bind, and can narrow the write surface with repeatable --allowlist prefixes.",
